# Optional operator fork digest for pq-devnet-5 gossip topics
#
# One 8-hex-char line (optional 0x prefix). When empty/missing, Ethean uses the
# interim SHA-256(fork_name) segment — peers will not share topics until this
# matches the leanSpec / operator genesis digest for the run.
#
# Also: --fork-digest AABBCCDD  or  ETHEAN_FORK_DIGEST=AABBCCDD
#
# Example:
# aabbccdd
